        "original_id": "a7b65e18-081e-5589-9609-3e1c7c6ecfa4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Vanessa; Le roi malgré lui\n- People: Samuel Barber; Gian-Carlo Menotti; Emmanuel Chabrier; Emile de Najac; Paul Burani; Nicolai Gedda\n- Organizations: Metropolitan Opera\n\nFacts:\n- In 1887, Emmanuel Chabrier's Le roi malgré lui was created as an opéra-comique in three acts with an original libretto by Emile de Najac and Paul Burani.\n- Vanessa is an American opera in three, originally four, acts by Samuel Barber, opus 32, with an original English libretto by Gian-Carlo Menotti.\n- In January 1958, Nicolai Gedda created the role of Anatol in the world premiere of Vanessa at the Metropolitan Opera.",
